            "value": "Override: CMUX_SOCKET_ENABLE, CMUX_SOCKET_MODE e CMUX_SOCKET_PATH (imposta CMUX_ALLOW_SOCKET_OVERRIDE=1 per le build stable/nightly)."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
